Z||000010||87ECO5||06-06-2000||10:11 AM||||BTW, for those interested ...<P>In addition to different gauge styles from which to choose, there's also two font styles - standard and racing styles.  The standard style uses the same (or similar) font to what's on the original gauge.  The racing style takes the standard style and adds <B><I>BOLD AND ITALICIZED</I></B> characteristics.  I chose the racing style.<P>I believe SloPonti also purchased these decals and is very happy with them.  Not sure which font style he chose.||||reg||1
