Z||000012||Spyder||06-06-2000||11:09 AM||||I was trying to figure a way to have a higher speed  speedometer without changing the needle (using a decal) and I thought that around 70 start doubling up on the numbers and have them closer together, even make the numbers go a little further around. That way it will keep you at  the right speed at legal speeds.  So 70mph would be like 80mph, or whatever it ends up.<BR>Just a thought.||||reg||1
